ok - reclaim: a herdr secondmate whose endpoint is gone is sent to its own respawn owner
ok - relaunch: a herdr secondmate whose pane vanished on stop is handed to respawn with its record kept
ok - reclaim: a herdr reclaim rebinds the endpoint and leaves the whole rest of the task alone
ok - fm-control relaunch: a launch failure after the stop keeps the prior record and reports the real state
